{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1396,
  "batch_count": 1689,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "4c77e29d79c031b121c5d2d0a53ce8b0070eb9a1",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7be8629603ae45ce0445be99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然大家经常年末时来目白家聚会……\r\n但是……\r\n我果然不大擅长应付这样热闹的局面啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73d29526cebe249cb895ea99288f9c0e7142c5789635d17836364cb536f64564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:053f43208bc4df336e9cd476",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……你今天过生日对吧。\r\n……那个……生、生日快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9df896f690513cbc7bada7f2c0de0509f93b5c2c68bfb878f677b53dc6c5e3aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a9a6abe925715bfe2415bfb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我给你准备了礼物……来，给你。\r\n……别在这儿就拆开啊！\r\n等你一个人的时候再打开看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b319582ffde58dd5e7da89b0ee9e90f037be0448826d524437c2cf17f99784ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2f9f7797f75614eea1a5570",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然很高兴大家愿意为我庆祝生日，\r\n但我就变成『寿星』而受人关注的话……\r\n还是会有些紧张的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ecbb1d3afa1b96554b50c588cbb7e8c521629967ebd01d03d326d42de501865",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20cbf958e7e012e4c0e18bbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然今天确实是我的生日啦……\r\n你倒也不用特意来祝贺我的……\r\n……但是……呃……谢谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86b52ff525db8fbdd3554733a718c1c1d594598e25d538e530a45ccc5332addd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:039d6ba5fa3d1789bbfae3c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新公告啊。\r\n……是什么呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b523cc33f6ae394d8d5ff829490247c56e9bde3c7599fab731c8e25e962dcad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:753278159454982bdbabdf7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物送到了哦。\r\n有人愿意牵挂你，真是幸福啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b72e93a3de03b0ae3ba814312ac707df944619db89e55d62a2776664dfc5c7a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad181b65c9589bc8de2192ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成了。\r\n……我也不会输的、",
      "source_fingerprint": "8461348af8eae25834338c126b03f7c13457bb2cc796cf20dc0a02931c1bc13e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ed7745f9dee199e52cf7432",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像最近又有什么活动要开始了，\r\n稍微有些在意呢。\r\n……我也能鼓起勇气参加吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "afd2a37626a723b42dac84db5c6538d111bb076f28e5f70e1e6a4e29f10626dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf3cc2f106d6c3af9f2c4275",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……怪不得最近这么热闹，\r\n原来是在举行活动啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f381aef4e0e7358e50c943f32dd7b7a91765c39d825454b96bb73026e817318",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22cf4544029497f0242106f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是我能更……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bee541f7d10f27fbb5b43ddec4f25a0665e36bc7a5ed429dc23f3081a0836124",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1abb111d9796e97f0803750",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升了呢。\r\n要去看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1436170c3422aa717338fe068a2fdc55cb127da0a7de2ccd171b7fa80d03df78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fe847dc6f74bceef1e81301",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こだわりっていうか…アタシも\r\nメジロ家だし。靴くらいは、\r\n気品ある感じにしたかったの…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6460e6f2d25255c2fca37f623d34b770d45ef0dbccb9179be00e5075272473e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a1357e8886cb4c6b04fd1de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日も…うん。忘れてない…。\r\n別に…ただの日焼け止めの話。\r\n肩焼けちゃうから…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9b15be03b9d942cccce159f0ad9a355d66087640019d6a9f9b5863911c14b95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abcd9948cf3d01d7fd843f7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お母さんも若い頃、こんな感じの服\r\n着てたんだって…今のクールな感じ\r\nからは全然想像つかないや。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73917e06e88a31287a656d4a648289fa81d9913ef2dec68b6bbce374841659e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88b992c6b7a06fc2bcbc9576",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不错的比赛……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b42b1e89269ac7339bdd8be0985cd01465e6c92c82f90f5898928ebc3fd493df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f9271c620549b12d1d42b15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很厉害呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12698ae02fc5ee2152a29727ac481dde1c8d5920911edb7f9d01d47c57e7196a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e26ec7e7d1fc4ac82402603",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是我能更……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bee541f7d10f27fbb5b43ddec4f25a0665e36bc7a5ed429dc23f3081a0836124",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3709b55af6e6c269a96b2fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不错的比赛……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b42b1e89269ac7339bdd8be0985cd01465e6c92c82f90f5898928ebc3fd493df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47f99e3e85c495ebba61d4f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶？！新纪录？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b63a244bd3e1ee95efaafe1fbf8de2268445f02c6ae8d2bede94d05253591d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f1e6e8f7b45ccb1179499fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要全力以赴了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a784a9cd790e71d5f1627d9a2b2c27398117813096dabde423bf6b00e7b510d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:754e76927932f57c35eb056c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "首席训练员最近身体还好吗……\r\n现在我已经完全明白她当初\r\n选择你的原因了……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efb86182a068f6df293885ab9ed73d0639e6effa29f23cabd96e2ec6a021a9b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e54f83f0d50395c25d10911f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是大家都像是训练员这样的人的话，\r\n我这样怕生的性格也能好转一点吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "deb99e5c37f5539931455ef2302b7de0a92bc349d80313d3b0b4abe128d03556",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4a5a3f826347d6d22c4017f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你还记得我画的『蔬菜少女☆萝卜子』吗？\r\n……我最近画得越来越好了哦。\r\n找个时间带给你看看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5344e4b5ac22dffabdb8d40afaa3373756a17dad052c97c22d45e5d2634b4991",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bab7b0680e4e610474322364",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……情人节啊。\r\n虽然还是不大习惯这种节日……\r\n那个……待会见。\r\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a4aeb513346d691a0549f165a47ca29268ae22746b299e329ed509e332a8d74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a72e7b563f2dd4c1c8a2c94c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我给你准备了巧克力哦。\r\n也算是……你能够注意到我这样的赛马娘的谢礼……吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1319e91c3c0b9b198d2389513401ee33fd96b0972088b9d905b2b8701ab6f69e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ad74aad607764435526b7fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在买礼物的时候，\r\n店员一看我，我就紧张得不行……\r\n但我坚持下来了……这还是值得高兴的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "03c2d16f317cceb081b04d3122576f44efd114ef41dce47b7d45a53ee26be8ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b253f5b3d9840176aaa21df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……生日快乐。\r\n……要是我的这番话也能成为对你的祝福就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a1dfef74479c9ff229e3b1571cb96b527b7b7795ded470cd46b25eb877643a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3c3e0be0bb1498b865952cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我为你准备了礼物……\r\n啊，请不要这么期待啦……\r\n真的不是什么了不起的东西！真的啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4f121fc771c567fb0ecb861b2d46465e7137de87e95812d40db1600925153cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b240a542ebe1b8b39898ce6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用特地祝贺我这种人的生日也行啦……\r\n……不过……那个……谢谢你，我很高兴哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14dc10e16d7c8a549fedd18bda3f050896a579272d746e6d6813efae38cd2f22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c228c546a9d9b672c8cef44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成了啊。\r\n……真厉害呢。为了不给你丢脸，\r\n我也得加把劲才行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d80bda60af69fb8b0e0cdfaf31633541e9bebcc77c67cdc56959b49183b2453",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:426dcc3c7b242edfc899adf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この靴、気に入ってるんだ。ほら、\r\nやっぱりメジロ家の一員として\r\n品格は示しておきたくて！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9963018afa5c49ddc00cb5b5884b2384adb9c8bc336a35ea57119bdf1c3fcb0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10125"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbf1fc1b60876adbabbb00ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よし、今日も…忘れてない。\r\n日焼け止め塗り忘れると、\r\n肩が焼けてあとになっちゃうんだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56eca8d5372986487b5d7c9ec1434660ae9f2f905ad52c70dba9fc172390e80e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aa4b30d3c4e5400020ff1bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我、我知道的啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b56d63ba504196ab0ebf49a41331690b739a939eb8026dbdd4b5827c64e24f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "1028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bbc1a3aca06754b9f28a26f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要、要上了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db24e744b988b17f9eee86f3be00e31cdf6718ce6c5d9360f667197ea4db1276",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "1033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cb63addec0f49818d4c1a2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……可能就是这样吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27eb7dea61e7e8337307c5f8d122b942dd2caa433f0d28d7011b0c64247cc854",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "1062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3f17e0bbe0f7b2b1528b019",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……拜托了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "000a6836699589a127774535b89ab882ee5c07f09d2a540fc4cc8b56c71b6b48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "1099"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64e5600c1459e1870e6ef9c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:621babedc48c654a178c9277",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你会让我变强的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd79575cc6ddf65ed97527d60731eeb8233ce9e6ae1dab7e38ffe651d0832c10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5bdc0dd3b7d1c85b17ed0a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想起以前的事情，\r\n稍微有些羞耻啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "66bd8dc3f8c401a3a6d947b78a1ac18f4afc2a88e47e9fc03e05e886c593b013",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cad9cb6a536ebb75164c5073",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "积累了这么多经验，\r\n也得习惯比赛才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9be3381c7b6e957f11bf8382ccf787b9d7e3482acbb3187699b4480e46916ba1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5da8501a8f972f53f5877481",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前辈，我也会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95fc4ca611ddb9a9489e406f52042c3a1b3e306f90a276f1bf497ee608d560e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "1123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8628b5333128338b419082de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83d668fc0807b3daa753e12fce799ef4162bc501184eea4a93ed315150e2bb2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "1124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7ce9f56a2a67a2e0a6129b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你们见识一下……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11c674fb9ea19a21ed6fa76680d3d31d577410e7d315e0d35aa4ad2b800160e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
