      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2f27bfe1cc3377fb57e4b5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等……呜呜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3a60b80799250ac66ad3a0af5f656d352cec06ef3c4c0447fac63859e2e62ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afe491c1206bc0602eed372f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天……能拿到这个呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaf36790390c7c57aab78fd990d3833da29d26277b1053cc4a0f6164f7ba0357",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:666885ec196501d3383ad970",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉身体好沉重……啊，不是。\r\n你听错了。那个……别管我就行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7495cb96b993537255137e3e79ae03edc485f17db7f7c0afd097a867392dfc34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10c1697481b459b54fbc62c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍微……让我休息一下吧。\r\n休息一会，马上就能继续努力了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "170f10f17a50a24ef106c1954d9937a004e14accde24054571b1b0fd751a2aa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:172509e8925a6c43ddc66c14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在感觉双脚好轻盈……！\r\n训练还没开始吗？！\r\n我想尽快开始奔跑……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7d1529bbe5c854398a39351c1c7d1c6ea3bb32aaf48b695576c3c13642aca0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc824e4622745c85eafb4e83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管怎么跑都冷静不下来……！\r\n现在的我感觉真是无所不能呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8565cfa34470eea011222796125725f023ce1453cef76fd62c667a7a1022bc5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:760a175b0915115fa653b0a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，感觉不错……！\r\n这样的话，一定能收获满意的结果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be3528d8b410f76d8b61d928f87e0dc1b668971042d43a93016a19482a695840",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87d5d6baeabe7c58aa950e11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天训练些什么？尽管说吧。\r\n我一定会完成所有的训练的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd6a59884b437cc3b09b5d6359fbe51d09b54d47a6028336127d99d82851001f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e42816ac82cdd4de93ca72b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也得加把劲才行……\r\n说说看你的计划吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cce0c4e7d8dddf94640a5b0df1a4c0ee075d603693b3945cf2cdf936901d7b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d366e59fbd78cf4b3617da91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要不输给别人的话，\r\n必须得加把劲训练才行。\r\n开始吧，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84dfefed10dcf189e76fba246284e8d7fa20651f0b36b926d414aceaabfac2a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:670cf80e9402412d36d84e5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……总觉得有点打不起精神。\r\n明明还想再努努力的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "85594cf75c2540b104fe19672451c4f9f3fa9b7640b854e6b81e3b38728d1a0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab448465e0c6da47c683dc75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊……怎么了？\r\n不就叹口气而已，我不是经常这样吗。\r\n只是……有点打不起精神而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49c47c4d4f546d7b09fd614d48f71ffb9117fcb38c6b904596f5ff9527785145",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4ea7863173c3f0e08f46383",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来见习的人……是不是有点太多了？\r\n哈啊……真讨厌呀。\r\n这样我根本没法集中精力啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ec2ee1b3307c932766e4e9b1cc2e23abe688ddb6b95e42f6c224d83533f382b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c7e0733c9231ac9b425b443",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明明脑子清楚该做什么，\r\n但是脚却没法随心所动……\r\n果然我这种人就是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "53a01b8d889c93a3e804305050e60c392adf702c839d27f87f237fb9193cd4f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:503bba6791b29e5917a115c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶？你真的想继续跑比赛？\r\n现在的我根本赢不了吧……？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22f0bae2abf5bdcfbea83e3552e1f55ec8cd18c3c0e348fc5b190f7c1bf6c879",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20021"
      ]
    }
